<title>USA: AMEX says short interest rises to 124.1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>AMEX says short interest rises to 124.1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said on Thursday that short interest as of November 15 increased to 124,130,557 shares, up 5,149,950 from 118,980,607 in the prior month.</p>
</text>
